---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout-landing-page.astro';
---

<style is:global>
  body {
    background-color: #FAFAFA !important;
    color: #111827 !important;
  }
</style>

<Layout title="2026 AT BOULDER BOX: NEW UPDATES & PERKS! 🧗‍♂️✨">
  <article style="max-width:900px;margin:48px auto;padding:32px;background:#FAFAFA;color:#111827;border-radius:8px;">
    <header>
      <h1 style="font-size:36px;margin-bottom:12px;">2026 AT BOULDER BOX: NEW UPDATES & PERKS! 🧗‍♂️✨</h1>
      <time datetime="2025-12-30">Dec 30, 2025</time>
    </header>

    <div style="margin-top:20px;">
      <div style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/2;overflow:hidden;border-radius:8px;">
        <img src="/assets/boulder-box-update-2026.avif" alt="Boulder Box update" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <section style="margin-top:24px;color:inherit;">
      <p>New year, same great vibes! As we head into 2026, we’ve got some updates to share regarding our pricing and policies to ensure the best experience for everyone.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top:18px;">💰 Price Freeze for 2026</h3>
      <p>We are happy to announce that our membership and entry prices will remain unchanged from January 1st to December 31st, 2026. Enjoy a full year of climbing at the rates you already know and love!</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top:18px;">👟 Gear Rental Policy</h3>
      <p>To help us maintain our equipment to the highest standards, shoe rentals and chalk will now be chargeable for all customers.</p>
      <p><strong>Note:</strong> These remain complimentary for all PT (Personal Training) customers.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top:18px;">🔥 Special Discounts &amp; Deals</h3>
      <p>We want to make climbing more accessible, so we’re introducing two huge ways to save:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Setting Day Special:</strong> Get 30% OFF your Day Pass on routesetting days! Come test out the fresh problems for less.</li>
        <li><strong>The Power Hour:</strong> Need a quick late-night burn? Get 40% OFF your Day Pass for walk-ins during the last hour of operations (from 9:00 PM every day).</li>
      </ul>

      <p style="margin-top:18px;">See you on the wall! Whether you’re an early bird or a late-night sender, there’s a spot for you at Boulder Box.</p>
    </section>

    <footer style="margin-top:28px;">
      <a href="/blog" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 16px;background:#111827;color:#FAFAFA;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">← Back to Blog</a>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Layout>
